{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10117220","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10117220","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1011722001:0":{"text":"Speaking of which, what kind of place is the Vaduso Mountains?","source_cn":"说起来，瓦度索山脉是什么地方？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12249210135FCC86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1011722002:0":{"text":"There are also many Wilders living there, and we share a common faith.","source_cn":"那里也有许多绿裔联盟成员生活，我们拥有共同的信仰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD65BBC8DFD5CB912","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1011722003:0":{"text":"They hold different ideals, and they are more reclusive. They don't interact with members of the Dark Forest often.","source_cn":"但他们与我们理念有所不同，更加出世，薄暮丛林与他们偶有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BA7B730F7692EA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1011722004:0":{"text":"Hopefully, we'll find Master Arden there and a way to save the Lucent Tree.","source_cn":"希望我们在那里能尽快找到雅顿贤者，和拯救流荧树的方法……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x322B3D73F05D389F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"Eironn",